  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "OpenMaui 10.0.110.3:\n- MAUI Effects on Linux\n- Setting `Shell.FlyoutIsPresented` from code did nothing\n- An Image under Fill alignment sat at its slot's left edge\n- Absolute rows of a grid whose height is unconstrained took their content's height\n- A Grid child's `Row`/`RowSpan` (and columns) past the defined rows made new rows\n- Rows of a Shell flyout header or footer below a fixed height took no clicks\n- Every Shell page was built at start\n- `GoToAsync` to another Shell item did not change the screen\n- Text measurement asked fontconfig for the typeface every time\n- A `StackLayout` with `Orientation=\"Horizontal\"` stacked its children vertically\n- A stack stretched a Fill child that has an explicit size\n- A page pushed onto a Shell section never got its size\n- A round ImageButton drew as a square\n- A Grid child spanning Auto rows or columns did not size them\n- Pointer positions from inside a scrolled or transformed view were in the view's own space, not the window's\n- A Grid measured with a finite height reported all of it for its Star rows\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
